# 🚀 3-Tier DevSecOps Project on K3s with Jenkins, Argo CD, Prometheus & Grafana

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates a complete DevSecOps and GitOps workflow using:

* GitHub
* Jenkins
* SonarQube
* Gitleaks
* Trivy
* Docker
* Docker Hub
* Kubernetes (K3s)
* Argo CD
* Prometheus
* Grafana
* MySQL

The application consists of:

```text
Frontend (React)
        ↓
Backend (Node.js)
        ↓
MySQL Database
```

