# ⚙️ K3s Installation

Install K3s:

```bash
curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | sh -
```

Check status:

```bash
sudo systemctl status k3s
```

Check nodes:

```bash
kubectl get nodes
```

---

# 🔑 Jenkins Access to Kubernetes

Create Jenkins kubeconfig:

```bash
sudo mkdir -p /var/lib/jenkins/.kube

sudo cp /etc/rancher/k3s/k3s.yaml \
/var/lib/jenkins/.kube/config

sudo chown -R jenkins:jenkins \
/var/lib/jenkins/.kube
```

Verify:

```bash
sudo su - jenkins

kubectl get nodes
```

Expected:

```text
NAME     STATUS
ubuntu   Ready
```

