# 📌 Important Lessons Learned

* Certificates open doors, but problem-solving creates opportunities.
* Real-world projects require troubleshooting, debugging, and persistence.
* Kubernetes deployment is more than running containers.
* Jenkins and Kubernetes must be connected through kubeconfig.
* Argo CD provides GitOps visibility and deployment management.
* Prometheus collects metrics; Grafana visualizes them.
* Learning happens through solving real problems, not just watching tutorials.

